# AzitWateringTreasureBox (35595) hit by a character holding a weapon (a Short Sword): the box is
# invulnerable and its script takes nothing for an armed blow, so a hit of all its 440 hit
# points leaves it alive, and nothing drops.
character Hunter 20
item 1
equip 1
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegablehall.AzitWateringTreasureBox
npc box 35595 Monster 40 0 0

hit box 440
advance 3s
